        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            ":::writing{id=\"48271\" variant=\"email\" subject=\"Formal Notice: Failure to Provide Door Repair Quote – Immediate Action Required\"}\nDear Ms. Adam,\n\nThis email serves as formal notice regarding the outstanding door repair quote that has now been delayed for over six weeks.\n\nA repair estimate for a damaged entry door should not take this length of time. The continued delay raises serious concerns regarding compliance with basic property management obligations, particularly those related to safety, security, and timely maintenance.\n\nThe condition of the door directly impacts the security of my property and my ability to safely reside in the unit. As management, you have a duty to ensure that essential repairs are addressed within a reasonable timeframe. A delay of this magnitude is neither reasonable nor acceptable.\n\nAccordingly, I am requesting the following in writing within 48 hours:\n\n1. Confirmation of the contractor assigned to provide the quote  \n2. The date the quote was originally requested  \n3. The reason for the delay  \n4. The confirmed date by which the quote will be delivered  \n\nIf I do not receive a clear and documented response within this timeframe, I will be compelled to pursue appropriate remedies available to me to ensure compliance with maintenance and safety obligations.\n\nI trust this matter will now be handled with the urgency and professionalism it requires.\n\nSincerely,  \nAmit Puri  \n:::"
          ]
        },
